## 1️⃣ **Organization JSON-LD** - theme.liquid ennen </head>

```html
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context":"https://schema.org",
  "@type":"Organization",
  "name":"HerbSpot",
  "url":"https://www.herbspot.fi",
  "logo":"https://www.herbspot.fi/cdn/logo-112.png",
  "sameAs":[
    "https://www.instagram.com/herbspotfi",
    "https://www.linkedin.com/company/herbspot",
    "https://www.facebook.com/herbspotfi"
  ],
  "contactPoint":[{
    "@type":"ContactPoint",
    "telephone":"+358-XX-XXX-XXXX",
    "contactType":"Customer Support",
    "areaServed":"EU",
    "availableLanguage":["fi","en","ru"]
  }],
  "address":{
    "@type":"PostalAddress",
    "addressLocality":"Helsinki",
    "addressCountry":"FI"
  }
}
</script>
```

## 2️⃣ **Hero LCP-optimointi** - sections/hero.liquid

```liquid
{%- assign hero_src = 'hero.jpg' | asset_url -%}
<link rel="preload" as="image" href="{{ hero_src }}"
  imagesrcset="{{ 'hero.jpg' | image_url: width:1200 }} 1200w"
  imagesizes="100vw">

{%- capture hero_alt -%}
  {%- case localization.language.iso_code -%}
    {%- when 'fi' -%}HerbSpot – kasvipohjainen hyvinvointi EU:ssa
    {%- when 'ru' -%}HerbSpot — ботанический велнес в ЕС
    {%- else -%}HerbSpot — botanical wellness in the EU
  {%- endcase -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

<img src="{{ hero_src }}" width="1200" height="700"
     fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="{{ hero_alt | strip }}">
```

