## 4️⃣ **robots.txt.liquid** - noindex-parametrisidonnaisuus

```liquid
{%- comment -%} robots.txt.liquid - noindex-parametrisidonnaisuus {%- endcomment -%}
User-agent: *
{%- if template.name contains 'collection' and current_tags.size > 1 -%}
Disallow: /collections/all/{{ current_tags | join: '+' }}/
{%- endif -%}
{%- if request.query_string contains 'constraints=' and request.query_string contains '%2B' -%}
Disallow: /collections/all?constraints={{ request.query_string | url_encode }}/
{%- endif -%}
Disallow: /admin/
Disallow: /cart/
Disallow: /checkout/
Disallow: /account/
Disallow: /search?*
Disallow: /collections/*?*sort=*
Disallow: /collections/*?*page=*
Disallow: /collections/*?*view=*

Sitemap: {{ shop.url }}/sitemap.xml
```

